  {
   "id": "mycelium-heaven-272965@1.4.1",
   "gameId": "mycelium-heaven-272965",
   "displayName": "Update 1.4.1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-12-05T10:23:08.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi !🙆‍♂️🧙‍♂️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once again, all of the feedback is being super useful, so thank you very much 🤗. I want the game to be as readable as possible because the challenge has to come from the puzzles, not from not knowing what's going on.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here is a little list of what changed",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Tiles now have a border!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Active tiles have a thick border so you don't depend on brightness only to see them. The contrast of the basic tile has been increased, and a new thinner border added so they stand out more on every floor.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Easier to read graves",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Numbers on graves now have a white border. They are also a little bit tilted to face the camera.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Meet Obo🎃",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The first easter egg! If you say hi to our dumb little friend in the menu; he will jiggle and bounce.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I have also been working on getting the game in the Play Store, and it was hard but things are working out! I'm going to start making the two new seasons soon, so this is probably the last demo update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We'll see each other when the game releases, but if you want to keep up with every little thing going on in the development (I might have an oversharing problem), you can tag along on X or TikTok (@3DGoblinDev).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Take care and have a nice holiday season! 🤙",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
